=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_b47c — Omar's tablet migrates from nightstand to kitchen by late morning (fork of p_8f2e)

The parent (p_8f2e) correctly places tablet_omar at nightstand_b1 during Omar's pre-shift morning, but the claim window 10–13 h is too broad. The evidence shows the tablet at the nightstand 6/8 in the full 9–17 h window, yet the 10–13 h claim accumulated 4 against. The resolution: Omar is still in bed or just rising through roughly 11:00 (he's a night-shift worker who comes home at 23:00 and sleeps until late). His tablet rests at the nightstand while he's in the bedroom. By 11:00–13:00 he's up, in the kitchen making his pre-shift meal (resident sightings put him in the kitchen at 12:00 on both d01 and d02), and he brings the tablet with him to the kitchen table as a second screen for music or video while he eats.

What changed from the parent: the tablet_omar nightstand block is narrowed to 7–11 h (the window where he's still in the bedroom); a new block places it at kitchen_table_k1 from 11–13.5 h (when he's in the kitchen). The claim is tightened to 9–11 h to match the higher-confidence window. Everything else is inherited unchanged.

What would refute this: finding tablet_omar at the nightstand during 11:00–13:00 on a weekday (it should have moved to the kitchen); finding it at kitchen_table_k1 during 7:00–9:00 (he should still be in bed).

